  ECONOMICS_AT_1.5_BIT_TERNARY  = REFUTED  (1.281x original at fp32 residual)
  ECONOMICS_GENERALLY           = NOT ESTABLISHED
  DELTA_COMPRESSIBILITY         = UNMEASURED  <-- the open question
  NEXT_MEASURE                  = entropy / sparsity of dW per group, which
                                  decides whether RESIDUAL_FORMAT=low_rank_delta
                                  or sparse_delta is real or aspirational
